WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:50.960 --> 01:53.500
<i>That boy doesn't have much longer to live.</i>

01:54.510 --> 01:58.630
<i>However, his life is being prolonged by the Demon that's possessing him.</i>

01:58.630 --> 02:00.260
<i>In other words,</i>

02:00.260 --> 02:04.720
<i>he will die if you seal the Demon.</i>

02:08.440 --> 02:12.860
<i>Maron, please! Steal my heart!</i>

02:12.860 --> 02:15.030
<i>Please, Maron!</i>

02:16.280 --> 02:20.820
<i>I can't handle it. Living a lie isn't...</i>

02:20.820 --> 02:25.410
...isn't living at all!

02:27.750 --> 02:28.960
Zen-kun...

02:37.800 --> 02:38.680
There she is!

02:46.430 --> 02:49.350
What was that?! Such rude people!

02:56.690 --> 02:57.610
Who are you?

03:01.410 --> 03:05.870
Only One Wish! To Father and Mother

03:06.200 --> 03:09.210
I saw her running around here...

03:10.160 --> 03:13.080
Why? Why are they chasing you?

03:13.630 --> 03:14.460
Blood!

03:14.460 --> 03:15.800
Where is she?!

03:17.460 --> 03:19.050
Let's split up again!

03:19.050 --> 03:20.170
Roger!

03:22.800 --> 03:23.800
Come!

03:28.470 --> 03:31.520
Exactly as planned.

03:36.900 --> 03:38.480
Sorry, did that sting?

03:38.480 --> 03:41.240
But you should be fine now.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.910
<i>Now for our upcoming news...</i>

03:42.910 --> 03:45.660
<i>It's been 24 hours since the disappearance of Sherry,</i>

03:45.660 --> 03:52.120
<i>the daughter of the British Ambassador Mr. Ed Stone, who arrived this past week.</i>

03:52.120 --> 03:57.090
<i>Whether Sherry has been in an accident or entangled in a criminal plot, is still un--</i>

03:58.380 --> 04:00.300
You're...

04:00.300 --> 04:02.300
- Uh oh! I better call the...

04:01.010 --> 04:02.300
- No!

04:02.300 --> 04:04.180
I don't want to go back to Papa!

04:05.140 --> 04:08.760
Why? Your parents are probably worried sick.

04:08.760 --> 04:10.480
Papa is scary...

04:10.480 --> 04:12.310
I hate Papa!

04:18.440 --> 04:23.360
Kusakabe Maron. The one that desecrates Jeanne d'Arc's soul.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.410
Hideous...

04:25.160 --> 04:28.450
What are you babbling to yourself?

04:28.450 --> 04:33.210
Weakening Jeanne's barrier is so tedious.

04:33.210 --> 04:36.250
You should just break it open by force.

04:36.250 --> 04:38.790
Direct attack is the best strategy.

04:39.960 --> 04:42.550
The plan is already in motion.

04:42.550 --> 04:47.010
This time, I'm going to lure Jeanne and go straight for the kill!

04:47.010 --> 04:52.730
Do whatever you wish. The results of both our methods will speak for themselves.

04:56.730 --> 04:58.440
Mama...

05:12.200 --> 05:17.080
<i>Papa should be home soon, so take care of the house until then.</i>

05:19.590 --> 05:24.130
<i>Because of certain issues, your father and I have decided to divorce.</i>

05:33.980 --> 05:40.650
<i>Mom, Dad... I wanted to see you so much...</i>

05:40.650 --> 05:42.650
<i>I wanted to see you!</i>

05:45.490 --> 05:47.110
<i>So warm...</i>

05:49.030 --> 05:50.530
<i>Mom...</i>

05:52.030 --> 05:53.950
<i>Father...Mother...</i>

05:57.750 --> 06:00.330
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

06:00.330 --> 06:02.710
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

06:02.710 --> 06:04.550
<i>- Energetic and...</i>

06:03.090 --> 06:04.550
- No...

06:04.550 --> 06:06.010
Don't kill me...

06:06.010 --> 06:08.510
Papa, don't kill me...

06:08.510 --> 06:10.890
Mama, save me...

06:15.350 --> 06:17.730
I just know there's something wrong!

06:17.730 --> 06:21.940
I have this feeling that she didn't "accidentally" meet Jeanne!

06:21.940 --> 06:23.480
The work of a Demon?

06:23.480 --> 06:25.480
What are you going to do, Sinbad?

06:25.480 --> 06:27.530
Access, keep an eye on her!

06:27.530 --> 06:29.240
Leave it to me!

06:31.160 --> 06:35.750
Sherry, I'm sorry, but I secretly got a hold of your mother.

06:35.750 --> 06:37.330
You can see your mother, right?

06:44.420 --> 06:45.300
Sherry!

06:45.300 --> 06:46.840
Mama!

06:51.140 --> 06:53.760
You must be the one on the phone...

06:53.760 --> 06:55.350
Thank you very much...

06:55.350 --> 06:58.640
Oh , no. I'm not really sure, but...

06:58.640 --> 07:02.150
...Sherry-chan seemed to be very frightened of her father.

07:02.150 --> 07:06.360
Since my husband arrived in Japan, he has changed drastically.

07:06.360 --> 07:08.530
He has been treating her very harshly...

07:08.530 --> 07:11.030
Stop talking about unnecessary things.

07:11.990 --> 07:16.450
How dare you hide from me and run off like that, Sherry!

07:16.450 --> 07:18.160
I'm not letting you escape this time!

07:20.620 --> 07:22.040
<i>The Petit Claire is...!</i>

07:30.630 --> 07:33.050
This is all because  you are too soft on her!

07:33.050 --> 07:35.140
- Dear, not in front of Sherry...

07:34.390 --> 07:35.140
- Shut up!

07:36.930 --> 07:40.140
Why? You used to be so kind...

07:40.140 --> 07:42.560
What has happened to you?

07:42.560 --> 07:45.560
You used to love me and Sherry...

07:45.860 --> 07:49.280
Love? Ewww, that's disgusting!

07:49.280 --> 07:51.780
I'm giving you a piece of candy, too!

07:56.660 --> 07:59.040
Sherry, Papa is right.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.040
Huh?

08:02.620 --> 08:05.630
How dare you defy us and act on your own.

08:06.960 --> 08:08.460
I will not forgive you!

08:11.090 --> 08:12.630
I will not let you go outside anymore!

08:12.630 --> 08:13.550
Mama?!

08:13.550 --> 08:14.640
Come.

08:14.640 --> 08:16.260
Maron!

08:16.260 --> 08:18.640
- Let me go!

08:17.140 --> 08:18.640
- Wait a minute!

08:18.640 --> 08:20.180
Sherry-chan!

08:21.350 --> 08:22.810
Get out of my way!

08:22.810 --> 08:25.690
If you oppose us, you will be arrested for obstruction of government duty!

08:34.610 --> 08:40.580
<i>Notice: I will be taking Mr. and Mrs. Stone's beautiful gold watch and pearl necklace.</i>

08:40.580 --> 08:44.790
Out of all the people, she's after the ambassador's possessions...

08:44.790 --> 08:47.330
She's audacious as usual.

08:47.330 --> 08:53.090
Weren't Mr. and Mrs. Stone going to the international airport this evening, to return to England?

08:53.090 --> 08:55.630
Which means that she's going to attack before then.

08:55.630 --> 08:58.180
Let's definitely arrest Jeanne!

08:58.180 --> 08:59.680
We can't move this time.

08:59.680 --> 09:01.930
Huh? What do you mean?

09:01.930 --> 09:04.690
The British Ambassadors are the ones being targeted.

09:04.690 --> 09:07.350
The honor of the Japanese Police Force is on the line.

09:07.350 --> 09:13.990
Even if we are the Jeanne Special Task Force, us normal cops aren't allowed to intervene.

09:25.330 --> 09:26.460
Chiaki.

09:26.460 --> 09:28.880
Don't go! It's a Demon's trap!

09:28.880 --> 09:29.750
I know...

09:29.750 --> 09:33.840
Then show some sense and don't walk right into it!

09:33.840 --> 09:35.340
But Sherry is...!

09:35.340 --> 09:36.760
Mr. and Mrs. Stone are...!

09:36.760 --> 09:38.840
The end result might be just suffering...

09:38.840 --> 09:41.600
...like what happened with Takazuchiya Zen.

09:43.180 --> 09:44.730
I don't care.

09:44.730 --> 09:46.640
- Thanks, Chiaki!

09:45.770 --> 09:46.640
- Maron!

09:48.230 --> 09:52.270
Whatever choice you make, I'll always be right beside you!

09:59.240 --> 10:00.410
Chiaki...

10:01.700 --> 10:03.950
What are you going to do, Sinbad?

10:03.950 --> 10:06.870
Mr. and Mrs. Stone are national guests.

10:11.290 --> 10:12.800
The hotel...

10:12.800 --> 10:14.760
The international airport...

10:14.760 --> 10:17.510
They're both undoubtedly under maximum security.

10:17.510 --> 10:20.220
Jeanne won't be able to get near them very easily.

10:21.850 --> 10:26.390
Then, the only time to <i>Checkmate</i> the Demons possessing the Stones...

10:26.390 --> 10:29.730
...is during the road trip to the international airport.

10:29.730 --> 10:31.020
But...

10:31.020 --> 10:35.030
Attacking on the freeway, even for Jeanne, is impossible!

10:35.030 --> 10:37.610
It's a city with heavy traffic! Access, let's go!

10:37.610 --> 10:39.240
Yeah! Gotcha!

10:53.340 --> 10:56.510
<i>There are only three things that God can do:</i>

10:56.510 --> 10:59.470
<i>First, create souls.</i>

10:59.470 --> 11:03.050
<i>Second, watch over those souls.</i>

11:03.050 --> 11:07.060
<i>Third, control the Earth's environment.</i>

11:07.060 --> 11:08.430
<i>In essence,</i>

11:08.430 --> 11:13.860
<i>the only thing that God gives... is despair.</i>

11:09.560 --> 11:11.150
<i>- So warm...</i>

11:12.310 --> 11:13.860
<i>- Mom...</i>

11:16.190 --> 11:17.900
Sinbad, it's an emergency!

11:17.900 --> 11:21.610
This isn't good! It's going to be difficult for Jeanne to <i>Checkmate</i> the Demons!

11:21.610 --> 11:23.070
What do you mean?!

11:46.390 --> 11:48.810
Which car are Mr. and Mrs. Stone in?!

11:49.980 --> 11:51.100
Sinbad!

11:51.100 --> 11:53.060
I really think you should quit this time!

11:53.060 --> 11:56.360
You won't be able to tell which car has the targets!

11:56.360 --> 11:58.280
What can I do?

11:58.280 --> 12:01.740
It's going to be dangerous, unless you can <i>Checkmate</i> the Demons in an instant.

12:05.820 --> 12:06.700
Maron!

12:14.250 --> 12:17.710
<i>Which one?! Which one are they in?!</i>

12:20.670 --> 12:23.340
<i>At this rate, Sherry's family is going to be ruined!</i>

12:25.300 --> 12:29.430
<i>For Sherry... No, for myself...</i>

12:29.430 --> 12:33.100
I'm going to fight until the Petit Claire never goes off again!

12:35.060 --> 12:37.060
Yes! That's it!

12:40.230 --> 12:42.150
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

12:42.150 --> 12:44.910
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

13:06.430 --> 13:08.640
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

13:08.640 --> 13:10.930
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

13:10.930 --> 13:12.560
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

13:19.230 --> 13:22.990
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

13:32.080 --> 13:36.120
I have no clue which car Mr. and Mrs. Stone are in...

13:36.120 --> 13:39.540
This time, Jeanne is going to get caught with one false move.

13:41.340 --> 13:42.800
What's the matter, Miyako?

13:42.800 --> 13:47.510
When Onii-chan went crazy, Jeanne turned him back to normal.

13:47.510 --> 13:49.300
It's not just Oni-chan...

13:49.300 --> 13:53.470
A lot of people who came in contact with Jeanne became calm.

13:53.470 --> 13:55.560
Jeanne isn't just an ordinary thief!

13:55.560 --> 13:57.770
I have this feeling that there's a motive behind this...

13:58.600 --> 14:03.230
I wanted to arrest her myself so that I could discover her motive...

14:03.230 --> 14:04.530
Miyako...

14:09.160 --> 14:10.160
Thief!

14:10.160 --> 14:11.700
I'm sorry!

14:31.600 --> 14:32.510
That's it!

14:55.540 --> 14:56.700
In the name of God...

14:56.700 --> 14:59.620
<i>Checkmate</i>, will you?

15:00.750 --> 15:04.210
If you <i>Checkmate</i> the Demons that possess Mr. and Mrs. Stone,

15:04.210 --> 15:07.710
they might die, like that one boy.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.020
What's the matter?!

15:24.020 --> 15:24.900
Jeanne...

15:24.900 --> 15:28.780
Geez, Noin! Don't get in my way! Begin the operation!

15:46.670 --> 15:51.880
Good. That's the way. Finish Jeanne in that tunnel!

16:09.940 --> 16:13.200
<i>The reason we got a divorce is you!</i>

16:13.200 --> 16:15.450
<i>Maron, it's all your fault!</i>

16:17.410 --> 16:21.080
<i>Our opinions of how to raise you clashed.</i>

16:21.080 --> 16:24.920
<i>We would've been happy if you'd never been born.</i>

16:24.920 --> 16:28.840
Maron, this is all your fault!

16:29.090 --> 16:32.800
I wish you had never been born!

16:32.930 --> 16:34.050
No!

16:35.010 --> 16:36.720
Don't say that anymore!

16:41.680 --> 16:44.980
<i>Because of love, humans experience confusion and suffering.</i>

16:44.980 --> 16:49.020
<i>Then, it's best to not believe in the first place.</i>

16:49.020 --> 16:50.030
Noin!

16:50.030 --> 16:53.360
Jeanne... No, Kusakabe Maron...

16:53.360 --> 16:56.070
Entrust your soul to me.

16:56.070 --> 16:59.530
Just as your parents did with the Devil.

17:00.040 --> 17:01.790
What did you say?!

17:01.790 --> 17:03.580
You didn't know?

17:03.580 --> 17:09.500
It was when your parents found out that you inherited the soul of Jeanne d'Arc.

17:09.500 --> 17:16.640
In other words, before you were born, they were possessed by Demons of the Devil.

17:16.640 --> 17:20.180
It's a lie. That's a lie...

17:20.180 --> 17:26.440
The parents that you loved never loved you.

17:32.990 --> 17:36.700
Your parents are within the Devil's grasp.

17:38.200 --> 17:41.490
Within his grasp? Where are they?

17:41.660 --> 17:46.500
It's no use looking for them. They are out of your reach.

17:49.630 --> 17:54.840
Or are you going to have God, who protects you, save your parents?

17:54.840 --> 17:57.590
God can't do it.

17:57.590 --> 18:00.640
Even God's barrier, which protects you...

18:02.140 --> 18:04.310
...is growing weaker.

18:07.890 --> 18:13.400
Now, dispatch the sacred soul of Jeanne d'Arc from your body!

18:14.400 --> 18:19.870
As long as you live, your parents will continue to hate you.

18:21.660 --> 18:24.040
As long as I live...

18:27.040 --> 18:29.290
They're still alive...

18:29.290 --> 18:31.040
That face is...

18:31.040 --> 18:31.840
Why?

18:31.840 --> 18:33.630
So that's how it was...

18:33.630 --> 18:37.420
Father and Mother didn't hate me from the start.

18:37.420 --> 18:38.680
Abandoning me and divorcing...

18:38.680 --> 18:42.180
They didn't make these choices, it was all the Demons' fault!

18:44.850 --> 18:45.720
What...?!

18:45.720 --> 18:49.560
Even if they aren't here right now, as long as they're living...

18:49.560 --> 18:51.560
As long as I don't forget about love...

18:51.560 --> 18:54.440
The day the three of us will laugh together...

18:54.440 --> 18:55.570
...will come!

18:58.400 --> 18:59.990
For that reason...

19:01.030 --> 19:02.820
As long as I have hope...

19:05.700 --> 19:07.330
I won't lose!

19:08.080 --> 19:09.830
Impossible!

19:09.870 --> 19:12.130
Noin! I told you not to get in the way!

19:34.230 --> 19:35.900
Jeanne!

19:35.900 --> 19:36.860
Are you all right?

19:47.790 --> 19:49.330
Get out of here! Quickly!

19:49.330 --> 19:50.540
Sinbad...

19:51.250 --> 19:52.540
Jeanne!

19:53.750 --> 19:54.840
This way!

19:55.210 --> 19:57.050
It's the same as that time...

20:01.380 --> 20:05.300
Jeanne d'Arc, go without me!

20:06.010 --> 20:10.100
No! She's not Jeanne d'Arc...

20:10.100 --> 20:12.270
She's not!

20:24.160 --> 20:25.320
Mama!

20:26.280 --> 20:27.910
- Papa!

20:26.950 --> 20:27.910
- Sherry!

20:29.330 --> 20:30.290
<i>Get out of my way!</i>

20:31.830 --> 20:32.750
Sherry!

20:36.630 --> 20:38.300
In the name of God...

20:40.260 --> 20:42.800
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:45.140 --> 20:48.310
I seal you here!

20:48.310 --> 20:56.310
<i>If you Checkmate the Demons that possess Mr. and Mrs. Stone, they might die like Takazuchiya Zen.</i>

20:58.230 --> 20:59.900
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:09.530 --> 21:11.660
Papa! Mama!

21:11.660 --> 21:13.080
Sherry!

21:15.120 --> 21:18.210
Thank goodness they're alive.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.000
I was so close...

21:21.000 --> 21:24.970
It's all your fault Jeanne got better!

21:24.970 --> 21:28.050
Jeanne...Maron?

21:29.760 --> 21:32.810
<i>The time has come! Queen is coming!</i>

21:32.810 --> 21:35.060
What?! Queen is...?!

21:35.060 --> 21:36.560
Isn't it too early?!

21:36.560 --> 21:38.560
I don't know!

21:38.940 --> 21:40.730
Queen is...

21:41.940 --> 21:46.280
I have to defeat Jeanne before that.

21:57.040 --> 21:59.250
<i>It's not currently in use...</i>

21:59.250 --> 22:02.630
<i>Father...Mother... Where could you be?</i>

22:03.380 --> 22:04.550
Chiaki!

22:05.920 --> 22:10.140
If we eliminate all the Demons, your parents' curse should be broken.

22:10.140 --> 22:13.180
Don't lose hope. That's what the Demons want.

22:13.180 --> 22:15.730
Cheer up, Maron.

22:15.730 --> 22:17.480
Chiaki.

22:18.400 --> 22:22.190
I will save them someday...

22:28.700 --> 22:35.290
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.080 --> 22:44.710
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.300 --> 22:49.220
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.220 --> 22:52.930
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.100 --> 23:02.020
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.610 --> 23:05.780
Never forgetting...

23:06.070 --> 23:09.900
...there is unending love.

23:10.570 --> 23:14.660
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.950
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.200 --> 23:21.170
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.630 --> 23:26.090
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.300 --> 23:30.180
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.380 --> 23:37.930
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.730 --> 23:50.070
What will you do now, Jeanne?

23:50.070 --> 23:52.660
Everyone around you is your enemy.

23:52.660 --> 23:56.450
I won't lose! <i>Checkmate!</i>

23:56.450 --> 23:58.620
I can't <i>Checkmate!</i> Why?!

23:58.620 --> 24:03.380
A Pure Demon such as I, Myst, could never be beaten by a human like you!

24:03.380 --> 24:08.170
I can easily destroy God's barrier that's protecting you!

24:08.170 --> 24:11.880
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne:  Evil Transformation! Myst's Assault

24:12.680 --> 24:14.180
The finish!
